<title>UK: ICI to complete Unilever deal by July 8.</title>
<headline>ICI to complete Unilever deal by July 8.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British chemicals company Imperial Chemical Industries Plc (ICI) said that the purchase of the speciality chemicals division of Unilever Plc would be completed for July 8.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
